{
  "provider": {
    "version": 0,
    "block": {
      "attributes": {
        "client_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Client ID",
          "description_kind": "markdown",
          "required": true
        },
        "client_secret": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Client Secret",
          "description_kind": "markdown",
          "required": true
        },
        "endpoint": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "GRPC Address to connect to",
          "description_kind": "markdown",
          "optional": true
        },
        "password": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Password",
          "description_kind": "markdown",
          "optional": true
        },
        "realm": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Keycloak Realm",
          "description_kind": "markdown",
          "optional": true
        },
        "username": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "User Email Address",
          "description_kind": "markdown",
          "optional": true
        }
      },
      "description": "This Terraform Provider uses the [gpcloud-go](https://github.com/G-PORTAL/gpcloud-go) library to interact with the GPCloud API.\n\n## Authentication\nAuthentication will is possible using a Service Account that is created within the GPCloud Panel.\n\nWhen using a service account, you need to provide the `client_id` and `client_secret` which can be created within the GPCloud Panel.\n\nThe service account behaves like its own user, all actions performed by terraform are made as service account user.\nThe service account is not able to create / update projects, instead an existing projects need to be manually created and imported using `terraform import` command.\nAll user-resources (e.g. ssh keys) are created on the service account user.\n",
      "description_kind": "markdown"
    }
  },
  "resource_schemas": {
    "gpcloud_billing_profile": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "billing_email": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Email-Address to receive invoices",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          },
          "city": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "City",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "company_name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Company Name",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          },
          "company_vat_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Vat ID",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          },
          "country_code": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Country Code",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The ID of the Billing Profile",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Full name",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "postcode": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Postcode",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "state": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "State",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "street": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Street",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          }
        },
        "description": "The datasource billing profile represents the Billing Profiles within GPCloud.\n\nBilling Profiles are defined on user level and can be applied to different projects.\nEach billing profile is receiving their own invoice at the end of the billing period.",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    },
    "gpcloud_node": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "billing_period": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Billing Configuration",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "datacenter_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Datacenter ID the node is located in",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "flavour_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Node Description",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "fqdn": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Fully Qualified Domain Name of the node",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Node ID",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "image_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Image ID to install the node with (ID of gpcloud_image or gpcloud_project_image)",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "ip": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "IP Address of the node",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "password": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Password used for authentication",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          },
          "project_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Node FQDN",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "ssh_key_ids": {
            "type": [
              "list",
              "string"
            ],
            "description": "SSH Keys used for authentication",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Node Status",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "tags": {
            "type": [
              "map",
              "string"
            ],
            "description": "Node Tags",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          },
          "user_data": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "User Data to be provided for cloud-init",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          }
        },
        "description": "Node is the representation of the Bare Metal Node that got created in the G-PORTAL Cloud.\n\nChanging the Nodes Image ID will cause the Node to be destroyed and recreated.\n\n",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    },
    "gpcloud_project": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "billing_profile_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Billing Profile ID",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Project Description",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "environment": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Project Environment",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Project ID",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name of the project",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          }
        },
        "description": "The datasource project represents the Projects provided by GPCloud.\n\nProjects can be used to separate different deployments from each other.\nEach project can have its own billing address, payment methods, members or environments.",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    },
    "gpcloud_project_image": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ProjectImage ID",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name to be used for the ProjectImage",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "project_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Project ID to place the Image in",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "source": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Image location (either http or local path)",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          }
        },
        "description": "In case the Images provided by GPCloud are not sufficient Project Images can be used.\n\nProject Images are custom OS Images provided by the customer. For details about what kind of images can be used\nplease check out the documentation [here](https://docs.g-portal.cloud/operations/custom-images/#uploading-images)\n",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    },
    "gpcloud_sshkey": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "fingerprint": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "SSHKey Fingerprint",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "SSHKey ID",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name of the SSH Key",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "public_key": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "SSH Public Key",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "ssh_key_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Type of the SSH Key",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          }
        },
        "description": "The SSH Key can be referenced in Node deployment to be used for SSH access to the node.\n\nIn case the SSH Key already exists remotely, use the `import` command provided by terraform cli to import the resource into the state file.",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    }
  },
  "data_source_schemas": {
    "gpcloud_datacenter": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Datacenter ID",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "latency_endpoint": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Endpoint used for latency measurement",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name of the datacenter",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "region_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Region ID of the datacenter",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "server_prefix": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Prefix that can be used to for server names",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "short": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Short name of the datacenter",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          }
        },
        "description": "The Datacenter is a virtual resource that allows fetching the Datacenter UUID by defining the Datacenter short name.\n\nThe short name is the short of the Datacenter as it appears in the G-PORTAL Cloud Control Panel (example: fra01).\n",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    },
    "gpcloud_flavour": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "datacenter_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Datacenter ID to consider for flavour availability",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Flavour ID",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name of the Flavour",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "project_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Project ID to consider for flavour availability",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          }
        },
        "description": "The flavour defines the machines hardware specs. Its UUID can be used to choose the hardware to be installed.\n\nThe name is the name of the Flavour as it appears in the G-PORTAL Cloud Control Panel (example: xeon.2288g.128).\n",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    },
    "gpcloud_image": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "authentication_types": {
            "type": [
              "list",
              "string"
            ],
            "description": "List of valid authentication methods",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "flavour_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Flavour ID",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Image ID",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name of the image",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          }
        },
        "description": "The datasource image represents the cloud images provided by GPCloud.\n\nThe resulting UUID can be used to provision nodes.",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    },
    "gpcloud_project": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Description of the Project",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "environment": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Project Environment",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Project ID",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name of the Project",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          }
        },
        "description": "The datasource project represents a project managed inside the GPCloud panel.\n\nSince the default authentication method does not support updating / creating projects, the datasource should\nbe used. In case a direct access grant authentication method is available, you may want to use the `gpcloud_project` resource instead.",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    }
  }
}
